      "caption": "VMX root mode runs the hypervisor; VMX non-root runs the guest at full speed.",
      "narration": "VT-x adds two modes. The hypervisor runs in VMX root operation, the guest in non-root. The guest runs natively until something sensitive forces an exit.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
